OL,3,GNEWSAStrategy to stop violence against
OL,4,Awomen and girls
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new strategy is being developed in a
OL,7,Fbid to prevent violence against women
OL,8,Fand girls (VAWG) in Guernsey and
OL,9,FAlderney.
OL,11,FThe Committee for Home Affairs said the
OL,12,Fstrategy reflected a commitment to
OL,13,Fimprove support for victims and focus
OL,14,Fon key areas including strengthening
OL,15,Fprevention and early intervention
OL,16,Fthrough education.
OL,18,FOfficials said it would continue to
OL,19,Fmodernise legislation and justice
OL,20,Fprocesses to ensure they were
OL,21,Fvictim-centred and fit for purpose.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,443,440,260,160,0,100
