OL,3,GNEWSAStrategy to stop violence against
OL,4,Awomen and girls
OL,5,
OL,6,FDeputy Munazza Malik said: "The
OL,7,Fdevelopment of a general VAWG strategy
OL,8,Fallows us to refresh our thinking and
OL,9,Freview what has already been achieved
OL,10,Fand clearly identify what our efforts
OL,11,Fshould be focused on next to have the
OL,12,Flargest impact."
